<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:30:33 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>特朗普的医疗补助计划削减了一些合法移民的医疗保险，包括难民和人口贩运受害者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/trump-medicaid-cuts-health-coverage-legal-immigrants-refugees-human-trafficking-victims-obbba/</link><description>此举是唐纳德·特朗普总统 2025 年减税和政策法对医疗补助进行彻底改革的一部分。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26282716538077-e1791644052546.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:02:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/trump-medicaid-cuts-health-coverage-legal-immigrants-refugees-human-trafficking-victims-obbba/</guid></item><item><title>专家表示，俄罗斯向美国供应柴油的协议不太可能缓解加油站的痛苦。 “这有点像泰坦尼克号上拖着躺椅的样子”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/diesel-prices-russia-deal-trump-putin-fuel-energy-costs-midterm-elections/</link><description>美国总统唐纳德·特朗普周五宣布，他已与俄罗斯总统弗拉基米尔·普京达成协议，立即向美国供应超过 30 万吨柴油。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26279001101075.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:46:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/diesel-prices-russia-deal-trump-putin-fuel-energy-costs-midterm-elections/</guid></item><item><title>欧盟表示，贸易协议可能会削减高达50%的中国电动汽车和插电式混合动力汽车进口，并降低部分欧洲对华出口的关税</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/china-shock-eu-trade-deal-chinese-ev-plug-in-hybrid-imports-tariffs/</link><description>经过为期两天的旨在平息因贸易失衡而升级的紧张局势的谈判后，中国和欧盟的高级贸易特使于周五达成了一项广泛的初步协议。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298884476-e1791642540746.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:37:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/china-shock-eu-trade-deal-chinese-ev-plug-in-hybrid-imports-tariffs/</guid></item><item><title>尽管发动了伊朗战争，特朗普仍然认为他应该获得诺贝尔和平奖，并抱怨获奖者是“没有人听说过”的人</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/iran-war-trump-nobel-peace-prize-winner-norway/</link><description>“诺贝尔和平奖已经被少数反民主、真正是文明之敌的激进思想家永远抹黑了。挪威，我们不会忘记。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26283028740262-e1791641980576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:25:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/iran-war-trump-nobel-peace-prize-winner-norway/</guid></item><item><title>高盛前首席执行官 16 岁时从公共住房进入哈佛大学，并表示高等教育是进入中产阶级的最佳途径</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/former-goldman-sachs-ceo-lloyd-blankfein-got-into-harvard-at-16-from-brooklyn-public-housing-says-higher-education-best-way-break-into-middle-class/</link><description>金融巨头高盛集团前首席执行官劳埃德·布兰克梵 (Lloyd Blankfein) 表示，教育是财富和成功的“真正加速器”，以此回击彼得·蒂尔 (Peter Thiel) 等反大学领袖。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-1056133280-e1773154688925.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:29:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/former-goldman-sachs-ceo-lloyd-blankfein-got-into-harvard-at-16-from-brooklyn-public-housing-says-higher-education-best-way-break-into-middle-class/</guid></item><item><title>Palantir 的亿万富翁首席执行官表示，只有两种人会在人工智能时代取得成功：贸易工人，“或者你是神经分歧者”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/palantir-ceo-alex-karp-two-people-successful-in-ai-era-vocational-skills-neurodivergence-gen-z-career-advice-billionaire/</link><description>亿万富翁亚历克斯·卡普 (Alex Karp) 告诉 Z 世代跳过精英大学学位，因为到 2027 年，五分之一的财富 500 强公司将招聘更多神经分化型人才。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GettyImages-2256666912-Karp.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:21:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/palantir-ceo-alex-karp-two-people-successful-in-ai-era-vocational-skills-neurodivergence-gen-z-career-advice-billionaire/</guid></item><item><title>Nvidia 创建了一家价值 5 万亿美元的公司，同时让员工自己支付午餐费用，但他们获得了更丰厚的福利，例如股票折扣</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/nvidia-employees-pay-for-cafeteria-meals-despite-trillion-dollar-valuation-jensen-huang-tech-company-perks/</link><description>在世界上最有价值的公司，午餐不是免费的，但慷慨的股票计划却更有利可图。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/GettyImages-2279256177-e1782849409497.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 13:17:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/nvidia-employees-pay-for-cafeteria-meals-despite-trillion-dollar-valuation-jensen-huang-tech-company-perks/</guid></item><item><title>“中国冲击”背后的经济学家表示，人工智能对于 Z 世代工人来说是一个矛盾的“技能不平等因素”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/david-autor-china-shock-nber-google-paper-illusion-of-competence-gen-z/</link><description>“年轻的专业人​​士需要警惕能力的错觉，”麻省理工学院教授、谷歌技术与协会客座研究员戴维·奥托告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/images_229683.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:49:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/david-autor-china-shock-nber-google-paper-illusion-of-competence-gen-z/</guid></item><item><title>据报道，苹果大幅削减订单，在当前经济形势下，价格上涨 100 美元可能足以吓跑 iPhone 买家</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/apple-iphone-18-pro-orders-cut-price-hike-memory-chip-shortage/</link><description>供应商表示，由于人工智能驱动的存储芯片短缺导致智能手机价格创下历史新高，苹果 10 月份最新 Pro iPhone 的零部件订单下降了至少 15%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2296232678.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:42:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/apple-iphone-18-pro-orders-cut-price-hike-memory-chip-shortage/</guid></item><item><title>给我女儿们的一封信：不要落后</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/a-message-to-my-daughters-dont-get-left-behind-2/</link><description>今年秋天，我的小女儿考上了大学。她的姐姐即将上三年级。这就是我想告诉他们的有关人工智能炒作的内容。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Square_AliKashani_ServeRobotics.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/10/a-message-to-my-daughters-dont-get-left-behind-2/</guid></item></channel></rss>